## Flow Diagram

\`\`\`mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Entry Point]) --> Step1[First Screen/State]
    Step1 --> Decision1{Decision Point}
    Decision1 -->|Option A| Step2A[Path A]
    Decision1 -->|Option B| Step2B[Path B]
    Step2A --> Validation{Validation Check}
    Validation -->|Valid| Success([Success State])
    Validation -->|Invalid| Error[Error State]
    Error --> Step2A
    Step2B --> Success
\`\`\`

**Mermaid syntax notes:**
- `([text])` - Rounded ends for start/end points
- `[text]` - Rectangles for screens/processes
- `{text}` - Diamonds for decision points
- `-->|label|` - Arrows with labels for transitions

